    "27"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Substitute \\(6\\) for \\(x\\): \\(f(6) = \\frac{6^{2}}{4} + 3(6)\\).",
    "\\(\\frac{36}{4} + 18 = 9 + 18 = 27\\)."
